---
description: Do not attribute git commits to Cursor or add Cursor co-author trailers
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git attribution (no Cursor)

- Never set git **author** or **committer** to Cursor, cursoragent, or any `@cursor.com` address.
- Never add **Co-authored-by**, **Signed-off-by**, or any other commit trailer that names Cursor, cursoragent, or cursor.com.
- If a tool or template inserts such a trailer, remove it before the commit is created.
